# Project Status: Aetheris
Version: 0.1.15
Status: stable

## High-Level Overview
Aetheris is an offline-first Temporal Intelligence & Environmental Sentinel. It replaces standard news feeds with high-integrity, multi-source validated predictive models powered by a 3D Kinetic Atlas.

## Integrated Metrics (Completed Layers)
- Offline-First PWA capabilities
- Deep history navigation
- Subsea cables & AI datacenter layers
- Live AIS vessel tracking & Satellite tracking (SGP4)
- Financial market monitoring
- World, Tech, Finance, Commodity, Energy lenses (Multi-Monitor Views)
- 95%+ strict codebase coverage

## Pending Items
- Macro-cluster visualization & Horizon impact clustering
- Archive compression strategy (KV payloads)
- Nowcasting interpolator integration
- Open-Meteo AQI replacement
- Background sync for PWA
- MCP server integration (39-tool access for AI agents)

## Alignment with Vision
The project successfully maps real-time environmental, geopolitical, and structural signals via a zero-cost architecture on Cloudflare edge. The backlog remains directly tied to the primary phases of historical and predictive depth, preserving the multi-monitor functionality mapped in the documentation.
